[
  {
    "document_id": "6092aeb4-bb78-5a1a-ae7d-91e6ae76b50b",
    "revision_id": "b4ea42b0299d43025303cb85e8f8667ea57333e6d18887970e9b5e01e258a9fe",
    "parse_artifact_id": "5a9af9ecf3b51a6ca859efc19194517d2064506252b0198cb8c75033f205e7cd",
    "unit_id": "body-5",
    "canonical_text": "动力请求报文名称为 SYN_PowerReq，发送周期为 20 ms。报文中的请求有效标志 SYN_ReqValid：0 表示无效，1 表示有效，其他值保留。",
    "locator": {
      "part": "word/document.xml",
      "body_child_1based": 5,
      "requirement_id": "R01"
    }
  },
  {
    "document_id": "6092aeb4-bb78-5a1a-ae7d-91e6ae76b50b",
    "revision_id": "b4ea42b0299d43025303cb85e8f8667ea57333e6d18887970e9b5e01e258a9fe",
    "parse_artifact_id": "5a9af9ecf3b51a6ca859efc19194517d2064506252b0198cb8c75033f205e7cd",
    "unit_id": "body-7",
    "canonical_text": "启动屏蔽期结束后，若距最后一帧有效 SYN_PowerReq 的时间达到 100 ms，则置位通信超时故障 SYN_COMM_TIMEOUT。未达到该阈值不置位；不能用丢帧次数替代时间判定。",
    "locator": {
      "part": "word/document.xml",
      "body_child_1based": 7,
      "requirement_id": "R02"
    }
  },
  {
    "document_id": "6092aeb4-bb78-5a1a-ae7d-91e6ae76b50b",
    "revision_id": "b4ea42b0299d43025303cb85e8f8667ea57333e6d18887970e9b5e01e258a9fe",
    "parse_artifact_id": "5a9af9ecf3b51a6ca859efc19194517d2064506252b0198cb8c75033f205e7cd",
    "unit_id": "body-9",
    "canonical_text": "自控制器上电起的前 300 ms 为通信超时诊断屏蔽期。屏蔽期间仍接收并更新时间戳，但不置位 SYN_COMM_TIMEOUT；屏蔽结束后按通信超时规则判定。",
    "locator": {
      "part": "word/document.xml",
      "body_child_1based": 9,
      "requirement_id": "R03"
    }
  },
  {
    "document_id": "6092aeb4-bb78-5a1a-ae7d-91e6ae76b50b",
    "revision_id": "b4ea42b0299d43025303cb85e8f8667ea57333e6d18887970e9b5e01e258a9fe",
    "parse_artifact_id": "5a9af9ecf3b51a6ca859efc19194517d2064506252b0198cb8c75033f205e7cd",
    "unit_id": "body-11",
    "canonical_text": "SYN_COMM_TIMEOUT 置位后，连续收到 5 帧校验通过且 SYN_ReqValid=1 的 SYN_PowerReq，清除当前通信超时状态。中途收到无效帧则连续计数归零。此动作不等于清除已存储的诊断历史；本资料不规定历史清除服务。",
    "locator": {
      "part": "word/document.xml",
      "body_child_1based": 11,
      "requirement_id": "R04"
    }
  },
  {
    "document_id": "6092aeb4-bb78-5a1a-ae7d-91e6ae76b50b",
    "revision_id": "b4ea42b0299d43025303cb85e8f8667ea57333e6d18887970e9b5e01e258a9fe",
    "parse_artifact_id": "5a9af9ecf3b51a6ca859efc19194517d2064506252b0198cb8c75033f205e7cd",
    "unit_id": "body-16",
    "canonical_text": "温度信号 SYN_MotorTemp 达到 90 ℃时进入热降额；只有温度降至 85 ℃或以下并连续保持 10 s，才退出热降额。资料不规定降额曲线或传感器标定参数。",
    "locator": {
      "part": "word/document.xml",
      "body_child_1based": 16,
      "requirement_id": "R05"
    }
  },
  {
    "document_id": "6092aeb4-bb78-5a1a-ae7d-91e6ae76b50b",
    "revision_id": "b4ea42b0299d43025303cb85e8f8667ea57333e6d18887970e9b5e01e258a9fe",
    "parse_artifact_id": "5a9af9ecf3b51a6ca859efc19194517d2064506252b0198cb8c75033f205e7cd",
    "unit_id": "body-18",
    "canonical_text": "只有 SYN_ReqValid=1 且当前没有 SYN_COMM_TIMEOUT 时，才允许采用本帧请求值；否则本周期采用零请求值。资料未给出请求值的物理量程或最大允许扭矩。",
    "locator": {
      "part": "word/document.xml",
      "body_child_1based": 18,
      "requirement_id": "R06"
    }
  },
  {
    "document_id": "6092aeb4-bb78-5a1a-ae7d-91e6ae76b50b",
    "revision_id": "b4ea42b0299d43025303cb85e8f8667ea57333e6d18887970e9b5e01e258a9fe",
    "parse_artifact_id": "5a9af9ecf3b51a6ca859efc19194517d2064506252b0198cb8c75033f205e7cd",
    "unit_id": "body-20",
    "canonical_text": "供电电压 SYN_SupplyVoltage 严格低于 9 V 或严格高于 16 V，并连续保持 100 ms，才置位电压故障。电压回到闭区间 [9 V, 16 V] 时，尚未完成的异常持续计时归零；恰好 9 V 或 16 V 不属于异常。",
    "locator": {
      "part": "word/document.xml",
      "body_child_1based": 20,
      "requirement_id": "R07"
    }
  },
  {
    "document_id": "6092aeb4-bb78-5a1a-ae7d-91e6ae76b50b",
    "revision_id": "b4ea42b0299d43025303cb85e8f8667ea57333e6d18887970e9b5e01e258a9fe",
    "parse_artifact_id": "5a9af9ecf3b51a6ca859efc19194517d2064506252b0198cb8c75033f205e7cd",
    "unit_id": "body-22",
    "canonical_text": "本规范只定义合成控制器的上述接口与判定行为，不指定 MCU 型号、诊断服务编号、标定数据、量产车型或事故统计。历史案例中的验证次数仅为合成案例记录，不能推广为可靠性指标。",
    "locator": {
      "part": "word/document.xml",
      "body_child_1based": 22,
      "requirement_id": "R08"
    }
  },
